            "concern_question": "Feeling Stuck in Career or Business?",
            "concern_description": "<p>Delays, missed opportunities, or slow growth may occur due to blocked energy flow in workspaces.</p><p>Vastu remedies support focus, motivation, and progress, helping remove stagnation and encourage forward movement.</p>",
